  "body": "Location, location, location!  Just a short stroll to Orewa Beach, local shops, cafés and everything this fantastic coastal community has to offer.\r\n\r\nThis charming home is sure to impress, featuring a recently renovated kitchen and bathroom that bring a fresh, modern feel. Two comfortable bedrooms and a large living room that enjoys afternoon sun, round out this great little package.\r\n\r\nStep outside onto the sun soaked, north facing deck, the perfect spot for your morning coffee, relaxed afternoons or entertaining friends.\r\n\r\n• Recently renovated kitchen and bathroom\r\n\r\n• Beach, shops and cafés an easy walk away\r\n\r\n• Cute, comfortable and easy to love\r\n\r\n• Sunny north facing deck.\r\n\r\nCall today to arrange a private viewing or I’ll look forward to seeing you at one of the Open Homes.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
